Alela, Artful Provocateur in BUW, built to Bracket 3 rules. This guide is a starting point generated from the decklist — the sections below group what the deck actually contains by what each card is there to do.

# The commander
Alela, Artful Provocateur :: Other creatures you control with flying get +1/+0.

# Game Changers (3 of 3)
Cyclonic Rift :: Return target nonland permanent you don't control to its owner's hand.
